    "group": "Warpstrike Champions",
    "summary": "As your opponent's turn ends, you can pick **HERETIC ASTARTES TERMINATOR**, **OBLITERATORS** and **MUTILATORS** units of yours that are not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any enemy unit, as many as the battle size allows:\n\n- **Incursion**: a unit\n- **Strike Force**: 2 units at most\n- **Onslaught**: 3 units at most\n\nThen take the picked units off the battlefield and put them into [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves).",
